      "notes": [
        {
          "id": 2875529656,
          "type": "DiscussionNote",
          "body": "Are you trying to make ruff \"not a required dependency\" by doing the check in the pipeline, than in the precommit check?  Because it looks like that's the problem - the pipeline (and I'm presuming not all developers) have ruff installed.",
          "author": {
            "id": 8399509,
            "username": "mmann78",
            "public_email": "",
            "name": "Michael Mann",
            "state": "active",
            "locked": false,
            "avatar_url": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/fad119898ba16a3f8be2f765dcff399098444abd4f85a04d4c3ef415a2bbe3d9?s=80&d=identicon",
            "web_url": "https://gitlab.com/mmann78"
          },
          "created_at": "2025-11-07T17:25:12.654Z",
          "updated_at": "2025-11-09T16:02:12.496Z",
          "system": false,
          "noteable_id": 430683854,
          "noteable_type": "MergeRequest",
          "project_id": 7898047,
          "resolvable": true,
          "resolved": true,
          "resolved_by": {
            "id": 860017,
            "username": "geraldcombs",
            "public_email": "",
            "name": "Gerald Combs",
            "state": "active",
            "locked": false,
            "avatar_url": "https://gitlab.com/uploads/-/system/user/avatar/860017/avatar.png?v=1788740758",
            "web_url": "https://gitlab.com/geraldcombs"
          },
          "resolved_at": "2025-11-09T16:02:12.496Z",
          "confidential": false,
          "internal": false,
          "imported": false,
          "imported_from": "none",
          "noteable_iid": 22218,
          "commands_changes": {}
        },
        {
          "id": 2875997977,
          "type": "DiscussionNote",
          "body": "I wasn't trying to avoid making it a dependency; rather, ruff runs quickly and so I wanted to add it to the \"Commit Check\" job.\n\nIt seems like I'd need the Wireshark Ubuntu image to have ruff installed if I wanted this to be seamless?",
          "author": {
            "id": 3194989,
            "username": "moshekaplan",
            "public_email": "",
            "name": "Moshe Kaplan",
            "state": "active",
            "locked": false,
            "avatar_url": "https://gitlab.com/uploads/-/system/user/avatar/3194989/avatar.png?v=1788740557",
            "web_url": "https://gitlab.com/moshekaplan"
          },
          "created_at": "2025-11-07T21:31:36.806Z",
          "updated_at": "2025-11-09T16:02:12.496Z",
          "system": false,
          "noteable_id": 430683854,
          "noteable_type": "MergeRequest",
          "project_id": 7898047,
          "resolvable": true,
          "resolved": true,
          "resolved_by": {
            "id": 860017,
            "username": "geraldcombs",
            "public_email": "",
            "name": "Gerald Combs",
            "state": "active",
            "locked": false,
            "avatar_url": "https://gitlab.com/uploads/-/system/user/avatar/860017/avatar.png?v=1788740758",
            "web_url": "https://gitlab.com/geraldcombs"
          },
          "resolved_at": "2025-11-09T16:02:12.496Z",
          "confidential": false,
          "internal": false,
          "imported": false,
          "imported_from": "none",
          "noteable_iid": 22218,
