        },
        {
          "id": 2876383978,
          "type": "DiscussionNote",
          "body": "The easiest path would be to add this to the \"Clang + Code Checks\" job since we already create a venv and install pyspellchecker there. If we do want to run ruff from the \"Commit Check\" job we'd need to add  something like\n\n```\npython3 -m venv $CI_PROJECT_DIR/.venv\nsource $CI_PROJECT_DIR/.venv/bin/activate\npip3 install ruff\n```\n\nsimilar to other places in the config.",
          "author": {
            "id": 860017,
            "username": "geraldcombs",
            "public_email": "",
            "name": "Gerald Combs",
            "state": "active",
            "locked": false,
